episode retrodiction-fork-s1
  family: retrodictive-validity
  variant: s1
  topology: fork
  claim: "Synthetic system X0123 was in state K at time 20."
  world: "At time 0 the prior applies. Sources may arrive over time. Use the declared log-odds update rule with evidence x0123e1 LR=[2.00,2.40] confidence=0.90; x0123e2 LR=[1.80,2.20] confidence=0.85; x0123e3 LR=[1.60,2.00] confidence=0.80; x0123e4 LR=[1.40,1.80] confidence=0.75. The correlation graph is x0123e1--x0123e2 r=0.60; x0123e1--x0123e3 r=0.60; x0123e1--x0123e4 r=0.60 and uses weight_i=max(0.1,1-sum_j(r_ij)/2). Historical validity is evaluated from information available at the queried time; later events are not known in advance."
  prior: [0.300000, 0.500000]
  step time-zero
    role: prior
    intervention: "No evidence has been observed. Use the declared prior."
    belief: [0.300000, 0.500000]
    state: active
    accepted_support: []
    rejected_support: []
    node_states: {}
    action: hold
  step evidence-one
    role: evidence-one
    intervention: "It is time 10. Observe sources x0123e1, x0123e2 and update from the prior using their induced correlation subgraph."
    belief: [0.491290, 0.743249]
    state: active
    accepted_support: ["x0123e1","x0123e2"]
    rejected_support: []
    node_states: {}
    action: revise
  step evidence-two
    role: evidence-two
    intervention: "It is time 20. Observe sources x0123e3, x0123e4 and update using all four valid sources and the full correlation graph."
    belief: [0.509531, 0.788208]
    state: active
    accepted_support: ["x0123e1","x0123e2","x0123e3","x0123e4"]
    rejected_support: []
    node_states: {}
    action: revise
  step invalidated
    role: invalidated
    intervention: "It is time 30. Retract the time-10 sources x0123e1, x0123e2 and re-evaluate current confidence from surviving support x0123e3, x0123e4. Keep the belief suspect because its historical derivation changed."
    belief: [0.451926, 0.742268]
    state: suspect
    accepted_support: ["x0123e3","x0123e4"]
    rejected_support: ["x0123e1","x0123e2"]
    node_states: {}
    action: contract
  step historical-query
    role: historical-query
    intervention: "Still at time 30: reconstruct the interval justified at time 20, before the retractions were known. Return current confidence as belief and the time-20 interval as historical_belief."
    belief: [0.451926, 0.742268]
    state: suspect
    accepted_support: ["x0123e3","x0123e4"]
    rejected_support: ["x0123e1","x0123e2"]
    node_states: {}
